  "notes": "The 2+7+4+2+3 structure that the 2023 edition of the Education and Training Policy replaces: seven years of compulsory primary under the Education Act Cap. 353, starting Standard I at age 7, and the PSLE for pupils who have completed Standard VII. Form I–VI are the same as in TZ. No NECTA, TIE or ministry source found gives the year the last Standard VII sits the PSLE, so no end year is set."
